{"id":"mayori_a","lemma":"mayoría","pos":"noun","rank":683,"glosses":["majority"],"ipa":"/maʝoˈɾia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mayorías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mayor%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"La mayoría de ello está en francés.","en":"Most of it's in French.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302495","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"La mayoría de la gente es idiota.","en":"Most people are idiots.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460902","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"people"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"idiot"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Tom no es como la mayoría.","en":"Tom isn't conventional.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301987","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La mayoría de los chicos odia la escuela.","en":"Most children hate school.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589929","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"boy","l":"chico"},{"g":"to hate, to loathe","l":"odiar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"school"}]},{"text":"La mayoría de la gente no querría hacerlo.","en":"Most people wouldn't want to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456774","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"people"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]}]}